Fictional EP Tracklist

Track 1: The Carbon Arc Breathes Ash
- Story & Context: During a citywide power cut in July 1989, projectionist Tiago Ramos jammed a roll of blank, rotting acetate into an unthreaded Simplex lamp inside Cine Roxy, filling the sweltering hall with the acidic smell of vinegar syndrome as blinding white light hit the bare masonry. While thirty trespassers danced on broken floorboards, Tiago slammed an improvised baile beat on his sampler and hammered the marimba until his wooden mallets splintered across the keys. The feverish performance ended when the arc lamp shattered into rain of sparks, prompting Ramos to shout through the booth's intercom: "Project the blood before the gate melts!"
